<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82825" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πευκ-ήεις</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πευκ-άεις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pine-covered</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔρεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.P.
					678
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>A.</u>
					1189
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of pine</i> or <i>pine-wood</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. σκάφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					863
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πευκάενθ᾽
			Ἥφαιστον</span> the fire <i>of pine-torches</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				123
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			metaph., <i>sharp, piercing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πευκήεντ᾽ ὀλολυγμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					386
				</span></i>
			 (lyr., codd.; Dind. metri gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῠκάεντ᾽</span>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυκᾶες:
				ἰσχυρόν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Theognost.
				<u>Can.</u>
				23
			</span></i>, but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεύκαες: τὸ πικρόν</span>, Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.394
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πευκᾶεν σέλας ἀστραπῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			 A; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. κέντρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					2.457
				</span></i>
			.</div>
